{"2740110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pets & Stuff", "steam_appid": 2740110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pets &amp; Stuff</strong> —  a cute, fun and relaxing game where you become a skilful groomer and veterinarian. Help little friends in trouble, make them happy, pampered, clean, well-fed, and don't forget to add a pinch of chic. Let your imagination run wild! Enjoy a fully responsive and polished gameplay, make the best trims, feel the fur at the end of your fingertips and capture the best photoshoots of your creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cuteness overload and furrrr everywhere guaranteed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are so many <strong>lovely animals</strong> here! Cats, dogs, raccoons, foxes, deer, and so many more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of products and tools available to <strong>treat and care</strong> for your little friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide range of cool accessories for the most <strong>stylish pets</strong> of all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple <strong>locations</strong>, with the ability to upgrade your clinic into the best of the best.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pets &amp; Stuff</strong> —  a cute, fun and relaxing game where you become a skilful groomer and veterinarian. Help little friends in trouble, make them happy, pampered, clean, well-fed, and don't forget to add a pinch of chic. Let your imagination run wild! Enjoy a fully responsive and polished gameplay, make the best trims, feel the fur at the end of your fingertips and capture the best photoshoots of your creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cuteness overload and furrrr everywhere guaranteed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li